With a record of having more than 16 of his albums reaching Number #1 in Billboard’s ‘Top New Age Album’ category, Yanni will be performing his new song ‘When Dreams Come True’ live for the first time in the UAE, along with melodies from his two Grammy nominated albums, “Dare to Dream” and “In My Time” as well as spreading the Valentine’s love through tracks from his 1992 smash hit album “Romantic Moments”. 

Having secured 40 platinum and gold albums globally, with sales totaling over 25 million copies, Yanni is a true master of his field. The charismatic, internationally acclaimed musician will descend on the Capital in February accompanied by a diverse orchestra, which has established an excellent reputation for their eclectic fusion of ethnic sounds which promises to enchant UAE fans. Mixing contemporary new age music and a blend of classical, j', 'og:type': 'website', 'og:url': 'https://www.ticketmaster.ae/event/yanni-an-intimate-valentines-evening-tickets/7497?CAMEFROM=FB_%20LIKE_YANNI%20-%20An%20Intimate%20Valentine%E2%80%99s%20Evening', 'og:image': 'http://s1.ticketm.net/img/tat/dam/a/58c/d522f448-1505-4bbb-8ea1-253aab8fe58c_944441_EVENT_DETAIL_PAGE_16_9.jpg', 'og:image:secure_url': 'https://s1.ticketm.net/img/tat/dam/a/58c/d522f448-1505-4bbb-8ea1-253aab8fe58c_944441_EVENT_DETAIL_PAGE_16_9.jpg', 'og:image:width': '205', 'og:image:height': '115', 'viewport': 'width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, minimum-scale=1, user-scalable=no'}], 'cse_image': [{'src': 'http://s1.ticketm.net/img/tat/dam/a/58c/d522f448-1505-4bbb-8ea1-253aab8fe58c_944441_EVENT_DETAIL_PAGE_16_9.jpg'}]}

